Package: leafwax
Title: Bayesian Inversion of Leaf Wax Hydrogen Isotopes to Precipitation
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Alexander S.", "Bradley", , "abradley@wustl.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4044-2802"))
Author: Alexander S. Bradley [aut, cre] (<https://orcid.org/0000-0002-4044-2802>)
Maintainer: Alexander S. Bradley <abradley@wustl.edu>
Description: Full Bayesian inversion of leaf wax hydrogen isotopes to
    reconstruct precipitation isotopes from hierarchical calibration
    posteriors. The likelihood is integrated over paired calibration draws and
    an explicit proper reconstruction prior, without dividing by sampled
    slopes. Multi-sample records jointly reweight shared calibration draws.
    A 100-draw fixture is included only for code-path verification; complete
    posterior deposits are required for inference and are distributed in the
    companion public data repository.
